name: Precious Metals Control Act (PMCA)
description: SR 941.31 — Federal Act of 20 June 1933 on the Control of the Trade in Precious Metals and Precious Metal Articles (Precious Metals Control Act, PMCA). Unofficial English mirror of the Fedlex consolidation of 1 July 2023. No legal force.
